{"id":"B1-L116","title":"Present Passive — introduction","cefr":"B1","level":"B1","unit":"B1-U07","focus":"Present Passive — introdução","targets":{"grammar":"Present Passive — introdução","pron":"Contrações e fala conectada (compreensão)","verbs":[],"pv":[],"expr":[],"words":["bread dough","resting time","wheat flour","baking process","gluten-free flour","yeast packet","bakery shelf","bread slice","kneading board","proofing time","bread basket","baker’s hat","flour dust","food factory","daily bread","whole grain","breakfast toast","local bakery"],"field":"Tecnologia","genre":"Receita e instruções","skill":"Escrita","words_min":18},"frames":[{"tag":"Abertura","title":"Lesson 116 · Present Passive — introduction","blocks":[{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Nesta aula","body":["**Foco:** Present Passive — introdução.","**Pronúncia:** Contrações e fala conectada (compreensão).","**18 palavras novas** (tecnologia).","**Texto do dia:** receita e instruções."]},{"type":"p","t":"**Objetivo de comunicação (B1):** eu consigo usar Present Passive (is/are + particípio) para explicar processos em receitas e instruções."},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Ponte para as provas","body":["","Esta aula treina **escrever frases claras e corretas (IELTS Writing, TOEFL Writing)**."]}]},{"tag":"Aquecimento","title":"Warm-up · Say the words","blocks":[{"type":"p","t":"Toque em 🔊, ouça e repita cada palavra. Depois tente adivinhar o sentido."},{"type":"words","items":[["bread dough","massa de pão"],["resting time","tempo de descanso"],["wheat flour","farinha de trigo"],["baking process","processo de assar"],["gluten-free flour","farinha sem glúten"],["yeast packet","pacote de fermento"],["bakery shelf","prateleira da padaria"],["bread slice","fatia de pão"],["kneading board","tábua de sovar"],["proofing time","tempo de crescimento"],["bread basket","cesto de pão"],["baker’s hat","touca de padeiro"],["flour dust","pó de farinha"],["food factory","fábrica de alimentos"],["daily bread","pão diário"],["whole grain","grão integral"],["breakfast toast","torrada do café da manhã"],["local bakery","padaria local"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · A recipe","blocks":[{"type":"text","title":"How Bread Is Made","paras":["First, flour and water **are mixed**. The dough **is left** to rest for an hour. Then it **is shaped** and **is baked** in a hot oven. Finally, the bread **is cooled** and **is sold** fresh.","Bread **is eaten** every day in many countries. Gluten-free bread **is made** with other flours."],"kicker":"PROCESS","by":"Food Science","gloss":[]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"Flour and water are mixed first.","ans":"T","why":"are mixed."},{"q":"The dough is baked before shaping.","ans":"F","why":"shaped and then baked."},{"q":"Bread is eaten in many countries.","ans":"T","why":"many countries."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“dough” = ?","opts":["massa","porta","dor"],"ans":0,"why":"dough."},{"q":"“shape” (verbo) = ?","opts":["modelar","compartilhar","chacoalhar"],"ans":0,"why":"shape."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"Present Passive","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Estrutura","Exemplo"],"rows":[["afirmativa","**Bread is baked.**"],["plural","**Flour and water are mixed.**"],["negativa","**It isn’t sold hot.**"],["pergunta","**How is bread made?**"]],"cap":"Present Passive"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Regra","body":"**Present Passive** descreve processos regulares: *is/are + particípio*."}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"Flour and water ___ mixed. (be)","a":"are","why":"plural."},{"s":"The dough ___ left to rest. (be)","a":"is","why":"singular."},{"s":"The bread ___ baked in an oven. (be)","a":"is","why":"singular."},{"s":"How ___ bread made? (be)","a":"is","why":"pergunta."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":